# Workflow Lanes

The project uses two workflow lanes.

Fast Lane is for experiments.

Fast Lane code belongs only in experiments or notebooks.

Fast Lane is for prototypes, disposable research, and quick validation.

Fast Lane must not modify formal src modules.

Fast Lane must not introduce live trading.

Fast Lane must not introduce credentials.

Control Lane is for formal work.

Control Lane requires a GitHub Issue.

Control Lane requires explicit Allowed Files.

Control Lane requires explicit Forbidden Scope.

Cursor must only modify files listed in Allowed Files.

Cursor must not modify Forbidden Scope.

Pull Requests must describe what was changed.

Pull Requests must mention whether tests passed.

When the issue is unclear, do not guess. Ask for clarification.
